OL,3,ABurnham says 'win-win' deal can be
OL,4,Aagreed between UK and EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said he believes a
OL,7,F"win-win" deal can be agreed with the
OL,8,FEuropean Union, adding it could be
OL,9,F"more like the Brexit that people
OL,10,Fthought they were voting for" in 2016.
OL,12,FThe prime minister is exploring closer
OL,13,Fties with the bloc and is expected to
OL,14,Fsign new agreements on food, energy and
OL,15,Fyouth mobility at a UK-EU summit on 20
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
