OL,3,ABurnham says 'win-win' deal can be
OL,4,Aagreed between UK and EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after meeting European leaders
OL,7,Fin Ireland on Thursday, Burnham said he
OL,8,Fhopes a deal could help lower prices
OL,9,Fand boost the UK economy. He predicted
OL,10,Fthe negotiations could "go down to the
OL,11,Fwire".
OL,13,FThe Conservatives have previously said
OL,14,FLabour are "dragging us into the
OL,15,FEuropean Union via the back door with
OL,16,Ftheir EU reset".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
