OL,3,AEx-Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang summoned to
OL,4,Atestify before Congress about affair
OL,5,Awith alleged Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FCommerce Secretary Howard Lutnick, who
OL,8,Fis under scrutiny over exports of
OL,9,Fsensitive Nvidia AI chips to China, has
OL,10,Falso been summoned to appear before the
OL,11,FSenate Banking Committee in December.
OL,13,FNvidia has lost $550bn (#415bn) in
OL,14,Fstock market value in just five days as
OL,15,Fthe scandal dominated headlines.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
